      "content": "rebellion? how is watching it die a rebellion. it just feels like being a spectator to a funeral. everything i love is already gone, it's just the ghost of it left. i'm just tired of being the only one who notices the decay. it feels like there's no real purpose in just sitting here waiting for the final collapse.",
